# Pad: Poly pool, 2-voice prototype (detuned stereo saw pair), 5 instances at v28-v37
v24 w0 f.22 a0 t0,0,1,0 m1
v26 w15 a-10 p-.5 t1.5,.5,.8,1.6 j1 k2000 q.8 c4,.2 C24,.2 G27 H27
v27 w15 a-12 p.5 N0,8 t1.5,.5,.8,1.6 j1 k2000 q.8 c4,.2 C24,.2
/pg 0,26,2,0
/pp 0,0,28,5,0
v24 l1

